      <activity id="e994450b-5544-54e2-a36e-51932985ce21" activityNameId="2714c808-6806-5210-a305-dfa68da5c710" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Solid unbleached board, SUB, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Solid unbleached board, SUB, at plant
na;
UUID: 7d20d397-0eb3-3487-b28c-3a9fdaba034a
This module includes the European production of solid unbleached board (SUB) in an integrated mill - including transports to paper mill, wood handling, chemical pulping, board production, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Estimation of European average data, based on data about unbleached sulphate pulp production and kraft paper production
Location:  Estimation of European average data, based on data about unbleached sulphate pulp production and kraft paper production
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European boxboard production in 2000: 11'664 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7d20d397-0eb3-3487-b28c-3a9fdaba034a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
